{
  "headline": "Omeprazole is not on FDA's shortage list; supply traces to two repackers, one with a 2009 OAI and a 2010 Warning Letter, the other with VAI inspections through 2026-07-16",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E6", "E18", "E8", "E17", "E16"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows omeprazole is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds two NDCs for omeprazole 20 mg capsules: 71205090790 labeled by Proficient Rx LP and 71335185209 labeled by Bryant Ranch Prepack.",
      "cites": ["E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Proficient Rx LP (FEI 3011557028) is a registered repack/relabel plant whose most recent FDA inspection was VAI on 2022-12-08.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407) is a registered repack/relabel plant that received an OAI classification on 2009-06-11 and a Warning Letter on 2010-04-08, followed by VAI inspections through 2026-07-16.",
      "cites": ["E18", "E8", "E17", "E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No FDA regulatory action is recorded for either plant at a date that precedes a shortage posting, because no shortage posting exists.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E5", "E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 4.2 days of omeprazole 20 mg capsules on hand; Corvale General has 25.9 days and can transfer 85 capsules while retaining a two‑week supply.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 85 capsules of 20 mg from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
